 "text": "What if AI took over the world tomorrow? Here's the timeline. Day 1. Nothing looks different. Your inbox is just empty for the first time ever. Day 2. Every meeting gets a one-line summary, and half of them get canceled. Day 3. AI agents start shopping for you, and stores start building for the agents, not you. Week 2. The AI asks before it spends a cent, and most people say yes without reading. Month 1. The people who wrote down how their work gets done are running 10 AI employees. Everyone else is still pacing prompts. Year 1. AI didn't take your job. The person who set it up first did. Want the five skills I set up first? Comment AI, and I'll send them to you free."
